Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-First Episode\NThe Kingdom of the Seas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.06,0:02:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I like the sea,\Nbecause it is big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There is the little turtle\Non the turtle's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There is the turtle\Non the big turtle's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Grandpa falls, they all fall!\NWhoops!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Wait!\NWhy are you mistreating the turtles?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they do wrong to you?\NLeave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.62,0:02:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, kid? Go away,\Notherwise we'll mistreat you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the money earned\Nby guarding the sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving it to you,\Nbut leave the turtles alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only 10 Yen!\NDon't make fun of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boys, you shouldn't\Nmistreat a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The turtle spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Let's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank me.\NI tried to help you, it's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but you gave me\Na much greater help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We were looking for exactly\Na kind person like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to help us?\N- Help you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Come with us, let's\Ngo to the dragon's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To the dragon's palace?!\NNo! I don't want to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? I don't\Nknow how to swim! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I go with you?\N- I'm looking for Tink...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I have no need\Nof you, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.30,0:04:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to help you anyway!\NTwo people can search better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink! Tink!\N- Hey! Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you again that\NI don't know how to swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If we go to the dragon's\Npalace, I'll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.06,0:04:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,\Nstay with us to help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But the dragon's palace\Nis at the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.98,0:05:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am afraid\Nof the depths of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're here, Tink! Get up!\NGet up, please! We've arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At the bottom of the sea?!\NBut how come I haven't drowned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go\Nto the dragon's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:05:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother and my grandfather\Nare waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And Princess Neptune is there too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Princess Neptune?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's our Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There are sharks! Let's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I hear..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's a ship\Npassing above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it down, so I can\Neat some pastries!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fed up with the food\Nat the dragon's palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad and too wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, little turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- Who is that funny little boy..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...who is with you?\N- He's a guest of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A guest? Give him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I won't give it to you!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really very funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it\Nin my little private zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give it to me!\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duck in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What a racket!\NOne can't get any sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, big head! Have you hidden\Nsomeone in that big mouth of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see!\NOpen this sort of trapdoor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My henchmen managed\Nto pull down the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job! Quite a nice haul!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty pastries...! Hey,\Nwhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,To look for a quieter\Nlittle spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to see\Nif I can manage to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let us out! Let us out!\N- Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I just know what...?!\N- Let us out! Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving me\Na stomachache!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! You saved our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we are going\Nto the Dragon Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Palace is cursed.\NRight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past it was very beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then the sharks destroyed it\Nalmost completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, I've brought a guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, don't shout!\NOr the palace will collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've arrived, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm here! And now you'll tell me\Nwhat I have to do to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought you here\Nto help Princess Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.74,0:09:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess?!\NShe's King Neptune's daughter, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she? I want to see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.06,0:09:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Neptune\Nis no longer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is she dead?\N- No, she's not dead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.18,0:09:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- But...\N- "But", what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am King Neptune.\NWelcome to the dragon palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a child\Nwith a kind heart, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.26,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink? What a strange name!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.94,0:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem different\Nfrom ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,\NI am not a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an angel!\NDo you know of angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel?! Oh, heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.10,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mr. Angel Tink,\Nhelp my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Neptune! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened\Nto Princess Neptune?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me,\NMr. Angel Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let's go forward
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Neptune\Nis in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where? I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll get you some light.\NLantern-fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Light the lantern, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How big this shell is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Neptune shut herself\Nin there four years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...and hasn't wanted to come out since.\N- Four years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did she lock herself away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a bad thing happened\Nfour years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, no one has\Nmanaged to get her to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Angel Tink, please,\Nyou make her come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.22,0:11:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shell! Shell, please,\Nopen up! Please, shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, open up, shell!\NLet the Princess out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.62,0:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's closing again! Princess\NNeptune, don't close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Shell! Shell! please, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune wants so\Nmuch to see Princess Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He feels so lonely without\Nher! Please, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's coming out! We've waited\Nfor you so long, Princess Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Princess Neptune,\Nwhy won't you come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.58,0:12:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why did you come?\N- Why are you meddling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We need Sapphire! Without\Nher, I can't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really not want me to\Nhelp you find your little friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very skilled at\Nfinding things, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.14,0:12:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you!\NAnd stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,While I am following you,\Nit will certainly happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...the opportunity to kill\Nyou! I am very stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find a way to cut off\Nthat beautiful little head!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Tink was\Nkidnapped by the turtles?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! He went out to\Nsea together with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tink..!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, where are you\Ngoing with such a fragile little boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm going to look for Tink!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gift from heaven!\NWith that wretched boat...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...she will drown before she\Nmanages to reach the open sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.34,0:13:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Sapphire will\Ndie! How happy I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,King Shark, you promised\Nme not to use violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but you haven't\Nkept your promise either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I will keep it! This\Ntime I will keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then you will give\Nme your daughter as a wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,..as you promised\Nfour years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As a wife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Princess Neptune!\NBut when will she come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Today.\N- I can no longer trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've waited for her\Nfor four very long years!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And... I can't wait any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please! I will manage\Nto get her to come out, so wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will wait for a\Nlittle longer, but hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.74,0:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Angel Tink, please,\Nmake the Princess come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I will never allow\Nhim to marry her! Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tink, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Neptune!\NPrincess Neptune!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.74,0:15:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hide there because you\Ndidn't want to marry King Shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes! But who are you?\N- I am Tink, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\NI will try to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tink,\NI must keep the promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it's an old promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you make\Nsuch a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To put an end to the violence\Nof King Shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me that if I gave\Nhim my daughter in marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he would stop tyrannizing\Nthe weaker fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow the shell\Nto open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tink, it was\Nto protect the weak fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, try to understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtles,\Nlet's all protect the Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If we unite,\Nwe won't be eaten by the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true! It's true! Let's unite!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the cruelty\Nof King Shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship is passing, I can feel it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull down that ship\Nand bring me whoever is on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he hasn't drowned\Nand that he is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! You've done\Na really good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the pill of oblivion. You\Nwill take it, so you will forget everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,.and you will do what I tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.\NLet's go, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now bring me some clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and put on one\Nof these dresses! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to show it\Nto Princess Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,After four years,\Nshe must be dressed out of fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now spread all the clothes\Non the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Open that shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Up! Lift it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm happy to see you!\NListen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.42,0:18:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sapphire..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,. Who are you? What do you\Nwant from me? I don't know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink! Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, let's fight\Nagainst the Shark King...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...together with the other fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight against\Nhim! He's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.14,0:18:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bully! He'll kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess Neptune!\N- Let's celebrate the wedding right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you marry her, will\Nyou stop being so violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father!\N- My daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.02,0:19:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to tell me what\Nhappened to you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I don't remember anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you saying? Is it\Npossible you don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Tink! Turn\Naround! And look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, why are we in\Nthis place? Tell me, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There, it's open!\NNow let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's here! She's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the bride is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,King Shark, do you swear that you\Nwill make Princess Neptune your wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,..and abolish forever violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Princess Neptune,\Neven if you wouldn't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...be the bride of King\NShark, do you swear anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...to put up with him and to\Nlive together with him peacefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what's gotten into you now?!\NDo you want to swear it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer now, otherwise I'll\Nget angry right away, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, swear it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.78,0:20:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Swear, or else...\NAnd who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Sapphire! Defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we were weak, but now\Nthat we are united, we are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.22,0:21:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shell, please, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We won! We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.54,0:22:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Tink!\N- We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.94,0:22:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray! We won! Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.54,0:22:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire! And\Nthank you too, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity I couldn't fight too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- What’s happening, Sapphire?\N- Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered now that\None day in the dragon's palace...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...corresponds to 50 years\Nin the human world! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, then we must\Ngo back as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.62,0:22:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wait, Sapphire.\NThey say that this box...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...grants wishes. Open it\Nwhen you are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.18,0:22:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if our friends have\Nalready become old people...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.30,0:23:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Nylon! What happened to him?\NHe seems to have turned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared! I wonder what\Nhappened...! Let's try to open the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen when we open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We could become an old\Nman and an old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.42,0:23:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to become an old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't changed! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a gift from heaven!\NSapphire must have drowned!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! I thought you were both dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.42,0:23:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:24:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing strange happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I had asked the Gods of heaven to stop time in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.46,0:24:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,while you were helping me.\NNow that the box is open,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,time has started to pass again.
